{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"Staying safe in the sun","theme":{"background":"#fff8e1","foreground":"#1f2937","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Ultraviolet (UV) light"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A type of light from the sun that you cannot see. It can harm your skin and eyes."}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Sunglasses"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"Glasses with dark lenses that block UV light, so it cannot reach your eyes."}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Can the sun hurt your eyes even on a cloudy day?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Yes","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"No","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"What type of light from the sun can damage your eyes?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Ultraviolet light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Infrared light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Ultraviolet light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Which is the best way to protect your eyes on a sunny day?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Stare at the sun to check it is there","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Wear sunglasses that block UV light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Sit in the dark all day","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-s","content":"You are playing outside on a bright, sunny afternoon. Your friend says you should look straight up at the sun. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Say no and put on your sunglasses","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Look up at the sun to see it","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-s","content":"Good choice! Your eyes stay safe and you keep playing. You remind your friend that looking at the sun can hurt your eyes."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-s","content":"Your eyes feel sore and blurry. Looking at the sun can damage them. Next time, wear sunglasses and do not look straight at the sun."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"How many of the 5 questions in this set have you tried so far? Pick the answer that is true for you."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"Two","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Five","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-h","content":"Well done! You know how to protect your eyes from the sun."},{"type":"text","id":"c10-m","content":"Remember: wear sunglasses that block UV light, and never look straight at the sun."}],"actions":[]}}
